<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.Africa's BOE in talks, cautions shareholders.</title>
<headline>S.Africa's BOE in talks, cautions shareholders.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's BOE Natwest Ltd said on Wednesday it was in talks with Real Afrika Durolink (Pty) Ltd which could affect the share prices of certain companies.</p>
<p>The companies are the Board of Executors Ltd, BOE Corporation Ltd, Samgro Invesmestment Holdings Ltd Boland Bank Holdings Ltd, NBS Holdings Ltd and Pepgro Ltd.</p>
<p>Shareholders were urged to exercise caution in their dealings.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
